        prompt += `  Samples: ${JSON.stringify(c.samples.slice(0, 10))}\n`;
```

**5. Prompt sent to DeepSeek:**

`apps/health-monitor/src/llm.ts:143-148`:
```typescript
      body: JSON.stringify({
        model: 'deepseek-v4-flash',
